§ `s 14 and s 16(1), (4) -- ordinary members`

#ASSERT `the person is an ordinary member` `a practising lawyer`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an ordinary member` `a foreign counsel admitted ad hoc`
#ASSERT `the person is an ordinary member` `an admitted lawyer (NP)`
#ASSERT `the person is an ordinary member` `a Legal Service Officer`
