#ASSERT NOT `the person is an ordinary member` `a bankrupt lawyer`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an ordinary member` `a struck-off lawyer`
#ASSERT `the person is an ordinary member` `a reinstated lawyer`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an ordinary member` `a reinstated lawyer convicted of fraud`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an ordinary member` `a foreign lawyer whose registration was cancelled`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is an ordinary member` `a lawyer expelled by the Senate`
