#ASSERT `the person is disqualified` `a bankrupt lawyer`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is disqualified` `a lawyer expelled by the Senate`

#ASSERT NOT `the person is a member` `a foreign counsel admitted ad hoc`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a member` `a law professor`
#ASSERT `the person is a member` `an associate member`

